# CivicConnect M3 Release Candidate

## Included

This release candidate combines the existing Member 1 and Member 2 work with Member 3 production-readiness/operations work and the integrated frontend.

### Backend
- ASP.NET Core Web API
- EF Core persistence
- Service Request lifecycle
- Status history and notifications
- Admin/Staff authentication
- Assignment management
- Health checks
- Correlation-ID observability

### Frontend
- Citizen portal with no-login request submission
- Staff portal
- Admin/management portal
- Login/logout/account switching
- Request queues
- Request details and lifecycle actions
- Reports/activity/notifications/team views

### Testing
- Unit/application tests
- API integration tests using WebApplicationFactory + relational SQLite
- Real HTTP E2E lifecycle test
- Authentication tests
- Negative lifecycle test
- Black-box/state-transition coverage

### Operations
- Docker staging
- Release validation script
- Dependency and secret checks
- Recovery runbook and backup drill
- JMeter performance baseline

## Evidence boundary

The repository contains implementation and repeatable test/deployment procedures. Actual runtime results must be captured by the team and inserted into the PED v3.0/RTM and evidence set.
